Chapter: ShiftNegativeConst

  cites Foreword chapter Console

 COMPILER-158: a negative constant shift count is refused at compile time,
 CDX2074, spelled 0 - k or -k.

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("shl " & show (bit-shl 1 (0 - 1)))
    print-line-uni ("shru " & show (bit-shru 256 (0 - 8)))
  end
